{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"9709","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v544","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"のり太","creatorId":"vndb:s1161","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1462","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1161","name":"のり太","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:41881","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"クロサキ","creatorId":"vndb:s1624","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3422","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1624","name":"クロサキ","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:41882","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"アマクラ","creatorId":"vndb:s6647","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:8763","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6647","name":"アマクラ","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:41883","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"ほしまる","creatorId":"vndb:s10301","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1463","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10301","name":"ほしまる","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:41884","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"嵩夜あや(由比雅雪)","creatorId":"vndb:s1162","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1181","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1162","name":"嵩夜あや(由比雅雪)","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:41886","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"森林彬","creatorId":"vndb:s2295","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:5285","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2295","name":"森林彬","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:41887","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"Angel Note","creatorId":"vndb:s758","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2558","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s758","name":"Angel Note","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:136799","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"椎名 俊介","creatorId":"vndb:s4410","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4410","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4410","name":"椎名 俊介","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:12038","source":"vndb"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"神代あみ","creatorId":"vndb:s2886","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:13729","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2886","name":"神代あみ","detail":"OP曲「トキメキDay by day」","roleCode":"vocalist","roleLabel":"歌手","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:136798","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"夕燈 とび","creatorId":"vndb:s1911","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1911","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1911","name":"夕燈 とび","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:12034","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"神代 あみ","creatorId":"vndb:s2886","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2886","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2886","name":"神代 あみ","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:12036","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"神代 あみ","creatorId":"vndb:s2886","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2886","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2886","name":"神代 あみ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:12037","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"アマクラ","creatorId":"vndb:s6647","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6647","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6647","name":"アマクラ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:12040","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c35453","characterName":"エリン・グィディル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"49806","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"134039"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24707"],"vndbCharacterId":"c35453"},"originalCharacterName":"エリン・グィディル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"78"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ellen is a hardworking witch from the magic land staying at the Yachikojima household. She was chosen as a student studying abroad in the human world owing to her effort. She is rather familiar with Japan (the human world), and speaks Japanese fluently. However, Ellen has a fear of heights and a complex about her tiny chest."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35453"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"遠い国から舞台となる八阿多市にやってきた魔女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひょんなことから主人公の家にホームステイし、八阿多学園に編入することになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"上流階級のお嬢様で、普通にしていても気品を感じさせる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園では優等生。好奇心旺盛。負けず嫌いで強情な一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は極度の近眼で、メガネを掛けないと本すら読めない。普段は裸眼で生活しているが、コンタクトを使っているわけではなく、高所恐怖症を隠すためらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間界に降り立ってから、テレビに興味を持ち、特に時代劇がお気に入り。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24707","sourceWorkId":"8439","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひょんなことから主人公宅に居候することになった、 高所恐怖症の空飛ぶ魔女。二年生へ編入することに なる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園では気品あふれるお嬢様として注目されるが、 負けず嫌いで強情な一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"こちらの世界に来てからは時代劇がお気に入りらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「こんばんは。こんな夜更けにこんな場所で、一体何をしているのかしら？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49806"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/6215057f36871becd1167efeee0f941b842a56770b66330ce0cc7f5e60a0f867.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7b5b8783da84ad2073bada4df48a8264efa53ae9793b2d93afbe912eff85c041.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c35464","characterName":"八千古島 華","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"49812","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"134039"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24713"],"vndbCharacterId":"c35464"},"originalCharacterName":"八千古島 華","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"74"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"150"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"74"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ren's little sister-like second cousin and younger step sister. Her mother and older brother died during a traffic accident, while her father remarried with Ren's mother. She is also the poster girl to the sweets shop \"Yachi\"."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35464"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の義妹。両親が営む甘味処「八千」の看板娘。また主人公と同じ八阿多学園に通っている。一年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人当たりがよく、しっかりもののようにみえることもあって、学園でも学級委員を務め、優等生として通っているが、実はかなりのグータラ娘。口癖は「めんどいなーもー」である。兄である主人公には素の自分を見せており、唯一、本来の自分を解放する存在となっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特技は菓子作りで、お店で出されている「季節のあんみつ」は彼女の手によるもので、評判のメニューになっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24713","sourceWorkId":"8439","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"甘味処の看板娘、主人公の妹で一年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人当たりよく学級委員も務める優等生だが、実際は ぐーたらで面倒くさがりや。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"兄の前では本来の自分をさらけ出し、心許せる存在 としてひそかに慕っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「いらっしゃいませっ♪お客さま、おひとりさまですか？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49812"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a32492cca937f159b0c1c5badeca4923c83b483ebb92071555ee9304d7a7e2e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/84dde3b2580199de8bacb6cc09683fd5e1eb9950824323088dcd02748058145c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c35465","characterName":"豊阿弥 文子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"49816","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"134039"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24716"],"vndbCharacterId":"c35465"},"originalCharacterName":"豊阿弥 文子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"153"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The secretary of student council and the class president of Ren's class. She has known Ren ever since elementary school, and has feelings for him, but she hides them with her tsundere personality. Fumiko is also known for her strict and stubborn personality."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35465"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"八阿多学園に通う女子学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おでこに眼鏡の、見た目は典型的な委員長タイプだが、その性格や振る舞いも委員長タイプで、学園では学級委員を、学生会では書記を務めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勉強は得意で、運動は苦手という、これまた委員長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お堅い感じで神経質、融通が利かないが、押しに弱く、勢いでまくし立てられると押し切られてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と鮎乃とは小学生時代からの付き合いで、何かと気にかけてくれる主人公にはある種の好意を抱いている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24716","sourceWorkId":"8439","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"八阿多学園に通う女子学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おでこに眼鏡の、見た目は典型的な委員長タイプだが、その性格や振る舞いも委員長タイプで、学園では学級委員を、学生会では書記を務めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勉強は得意で、運動は苦手という、これまた委員長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お堅い感じで神経質、融通が利かないが、押しに弱く、勢いでまくし立てられると押し切られてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と鮎乃とは小学生時代からの付き合いで、何かと気にかけてくれる主人公にはある種の好意を抱いている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49816"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd45c6e2c0920c092e9de4a3032a441e5cd15e030165628517775568de7b9dc1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/9262700d968546227477f6a1b71fc6124b275e8563ffb1bcf7023b6475c3271d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c35467","characterName":"天矢 鮎乃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"49817","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"134039"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24714"],"vndbCharacterId":"c35467"},"originalCharacterName":"天矢 鮎乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"171"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ren's best and childhood friend who is a member of the martial arts club. Because of her tomboyish looks and personality, she is popular with the girls. A bit of narciccist, but she has her well-mannered side as well. Ayuno is also the younger sister of Miu, whom she does not get along with."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35467"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"蓮の幼馴染みであり、また親友と呼べる間柄の少女。それなりに名の知れた旧家の出ながら勉学よりもスポーツを好み、陸上部員として出場する県大会では一目置かれる存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やや皮肉屋の一面も有するが、基本的には策を弄するより直感的に行動する方を好んでおり、頭脳派の蓮とは殊更相性が良い。他人の言葉には耳を貸さない唯我独尊ナルシスト傾向で、ホストの様な立ち振る舞いを見せるも、おだてられるとその気になってしまう微笑ましい弱点がまた彼女のチャームポイントでもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉は深雨。彼女の唯一にして最大の天敵で、深雨の常駐する保健室へは近寄ることがない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24714","sourceWorkId":"8439","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"八阿多学園に通う女子学生。主人公の幼馴染で、親友と呼べる間柄の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それなりに名の知れた旧家のご息女。勉学よりもスポーツを好み、陸上選手として県大会に出場するほどの実力を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"考えるよりも直観を優先するタイプ。皮肉屋の一面を持ち、他人の言葉には耳を貸さない唯我独尊なところがあり、ナルシスト的な傾向を持ち、おだてられると調子に乗りやすい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じ学園の養護教諭、深雨は実姉。彼女自身、姉を天敵と思っているらしく、保健室に近寄ろうとしない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49817"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a83ab8b4a6e6a8755b9f0cba826f57236afb81b80a77d646780e66719851551f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/0885613677bcad42eec0f3ca640c1ce36a5cc306b3a9cf8cb78ee54ec0dc0c8b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c10778","characterName":"鏑木 瑞穂","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c10778"},"originalCharacterName":"鏑木 瑞穂","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"512"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"173"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mizuho is a male protagonist who transfers to an all-girls school per his grandfather's will and must crossdress in order to attend. He already looks very androgynous, so the change thankfully isn't obvious to the other members of the school. However, Mizuho is always nervous about being found out and constantly worries that it will happen. In spite of this, he was well received on his first day at school and has already become very popular among the students. At first he was shocked when he found out about the will, but with the help of his childhood friend Mariya Mikado, who also attends the school, he was able to resign himself to transferring to the school. Despite making the change, he still uses language which is usually only used by males in Japan such as boku (僕), meaning \"I\". He is generally depicted in his school uniform wearing breast prostheses underneath."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mizuho had to use the surname Miyanokouji, his mother's maiden name, in order to enter into the school; his actual surname is Kaburagi (鏑木). The Kaburagi family's biggest rival is the Itsukushima family, both of which are very well-endowed in terms of money and power. Mizuho didn't realize it at first, but Takako is a member of that Itsukushima family. Despite this, Mizuho doesn't see her as a rival and enjoys her company very much. In fact, they share world history class together and sit next to each other. They often talk to each other during class by either whispering or passing notes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10778"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e834461c198583418527b3613f9c4e37323c13afad460919a574ddb606297af1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/4889043d4c33066399eff8c1127af2e2d7f1bd6b68216385d27db76a8b04ac4b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c10779","characterName":"十条 紫苑","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c10779"},"originalCharacterName":"十条 紫苑","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"321"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"173"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shion is one of Mizuho's classmates who figures out that he is a boy almost immediately, after their second meeting, but tells him that she will keep it a secret from anyone else. She tends to have a silent demeanor and voice which helps to give her an appealing appearance to the rest of the students. The previous year, she actually had to leave school for a time soon after she was elected as the Elder due to an illness and had to spend her time in the hospital. In effect, she has come back this year in order to repeat her last year, though she still isn't fully recovered, as she will pass out if she exerts herself too much. She becomes an adviser and a female role-model for Mizuho."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has been engaged to Kazutaka Itsukushima who is Takako's older brother in Shion's path; Itsukushima family is upstart, and so Takako's father made Kazutaka to be engaged to Shion in order to get Juujou family status because the Juujou family is a former aristocratic (Kōshaku (侯爵)) family. Takako asks Mizuho to rescue Shion from the Itsukushima family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10779"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/9709acef7a929d066af395260992542dfcc1f5248d9f21e1a853ce2b972ec104.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8e67979b0969a66c386b94628babb1287cff01fabe093344479e1eb584d0e6f4.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c10798","characterName":"上岡 由佳里","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c10798"},"originalCharacterName":"上岡 由佳里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"218"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yukari is one of the first year students at the school who lives in the same dormitory building as Mizuho and Mariya, who also is her onee-sama; it is a tradition for the underclassmen to serve their respective senpai any way they can. Much like Kana and Mariya, she is a very energetic girl, although unlike them, she is deathly afraid of ghost stories and anything scary - a fact which Mariya has often used for her own amusement and which initially caused some trouble when Yukari met Ichiko."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yukari is on the track and field team along with Mariya, though her main reason for joining was due to her older sister-in-law who had urged her to come to this school and who was also in track and field. However, Yukari soon comes to discover that she really does have a liking for track and field and continues activities in the club even after a time of losing much of her self-confidence."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her another name is \"Kohaku no Kimi\" at Seio Girls' Academy."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She became the student council president and the captain of the track and field club."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Incidentally, she retires from the club just before Mizuho's graduation and she begins to study in earnest so that she will enter Mizuho's university in her path."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10798"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f585faef613ec16077de07c0ed6906bd7f20c5039497984332423dceae8718f3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b65f8a8f5ba73774064c1073ff33ab87ea9fead826db1b07420c6bf6b9c94b28.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c10799","characterName":"厳島 貴子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c10799"},"originalCharacterName":"厳島 貴子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1116"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Takako is the student council president of the all-girls school where the story takes place. She tends to have a serious personality which compliments that of a student council president. As the president, she knows that she must be very decisive in her actions and thus cannot often hesitate with her decisions, since she knows the students would have trouble following her if she didn't act as such. As it is, Takako herself has stated how she almost never has confidence in herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In contrast to her usual attitude, she has shown herself to have a more gentle side to her character. Eventually, she begins to form feelings for Mizuho, though while still under the belief that Mizuho is a girl, she is at first confused about what she has been feeling. She also has a high fear of ghosts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A few years back, Takako was invited to join the track and field team during the same time that the election for new student council members was being held. It was not that she didn't want to join track and field, but ultimately she declined their offer and was able to get elected to the student council. After this incident, Mariya, who is also in the Track and Field Club, thought that her response was unforgivable and thus has carried a grudge against Takako ever since. The truth of the matter was that Takako couldn't handle both the track and field and student council activities simultaneously, though Mariya could never accept this as the truth. She also falls in love with Mizuho even before she finds out his secret."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10799"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2f/2fd81b9193edc75de02db270a932dec9aed43123b4f5165398c40b55ee262778.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a66b0d4fa2a9e03e7b7ce7a433027b3cb21ca43019624d35aef76fd39e8e189.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c11020","characterName":"月瀬 小夜音","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c11020"},"originalCharacterName":"月瀬 小夜音","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"418"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"172"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c12a26bc909eaf8d2e003dd48aecd35503d60ad47ef031ad3bbe43c0623ef29.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d6e4df95de368cc8fa14e2c2ea4870029da788138d9d4fec4972cb7105c0763e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c11022","characterName":"觀興寺 六花","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c11022"},"origin